  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Londonderry, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Your Government   \t\t\t \n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business   \t\t\t \n     Watch   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Boston Post Cane \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Tax Status Information \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t\t Registration Lost in the Mail \r\n\t\t\t\t New Residents to Londonderry \r\n\t\t\t\t Registering a Newly Purchased Vehicle \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t\t Vital Records (Birth, Death & Marriage Certificates) \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Absentee Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Filing for Office \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\n\t\t\t Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t Power of Attorney (PDF) \r\nHome \nYour Government \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nWelcome to Londonderry's Town Clerk and Tax Collector office. We are open to the public Monday through Friday, from 8:30 a.m. to 5 p.m. \nMission \nTo safely and accurately make collections and timely deposits of Town monies; to record and preserve vital records of the community; and to consistently, courteously, and efficiently serve our customers in the areas of vehicle registrations, property tax / sewer payments, marriage licenses, dog licenses, voter registration, and elections, vital records and boat registrations. \nOnline Services \nFor Online Vehicle Registration Renewals \nOnline registration is available for  RENEWALS only . All renewed registrations and decals will be mailed to the address currently on file with the New Hampshire DMV. Pickup is not available for online renewals. Newly purchased vehicles must be registered directly through the Town Clerk’s Office. \nPlease do not renew online if you need to make any changes to your registration, including: \nAddress changes \nPlate changes \nOwnership changes \nThese changes must be completed directly through the Town Clerk’s Office. \nIf you do not receive your registration and decals by mail, a replacement may be obtained for a FEE at the Town Clerk’s Office. If it has been more than two weeks since your renewal, a replacement may be obtained at no cost at a New Hampshire DMV location. \r\nFAQs \r\n                 How do I prove residency in the Town of Londonderry? \r\nClosing papers on a home or an occupancy permit issued by the Building Department. \nRental agreement. \nA utility bills, such as gas, electric, or bank statements. \nA pay stub or W2 with your current address. \nA notarized letter from the property owner where you are claiming residency. (If you are living with someone and they rent, and you are not on the rental agreement, you must have the notarized letter from the  landlord  stating you live at that address.) \r\n                 Can I pay by credit card? \r\nYes. Currently, there is a 2.99% fee . \r\n                 Can I pay with an out-of-state check? \r\nYes. \r\n                 What do I need to register a motor vehicle if I am moving to Londonderry from out-of-state? \r\nProof of residency. \nIf you own your car, the title and current valid registration. You must have the title; we  cannot  accept a copy or fax pursuant to to New Hampshire state law. \nIf you have a loan or a leased vehicle, please call our office at 603-432-1100, ext. 195, as there are many questions we need to ask you to be sure we can process this quickly and effectively in the most convenient way. \nPayment, which can be made by one check (payable to the Town of Londonderry), cash, or credit cards (with an added 2.99% convenience fee ). \r\n                 What do I need to bring if I want to transfer my plates? \r\nThe original registration; no copies are allowed. \nThe transfer must be going from the “same name to the same name.” The  first name  of the registration is the  same name  that should be on the new paperwork. Only when a vehicle is leased can the leasing company be different. You still must be on the original lease agreement and the new paperwork. Please call 603-432-1100, ext. 195 for details, as this can be  confusing.  \nCertificate of Origin, Certificate of Title, or application of Certificate of Title from the dealership. \nOne check (payable to the Town of Londonderry), cash, or credit cards (with an added 2.99% convenience fee ). \nMost registrations can be completed at the Londonderry Town Hall, with a few exceptions (such as vehicles over 26,000 pounds). You must start the process at the Londonderry Town Hall first. If needed, the process will be completed at the State Department of Motor Vehicles. \r\n                 Can I register my car online? \r\nYes, but only a straight renewal with no changes can be completed online. \r\n                 If I register my car online and get stopped is my registration valid? \r\nNo. Until you physically have the registrations and stickers, it is not registered. Please be sure to allow 5 to 7 business days for processing and mailing. \r\n                 Can I get vanity plates or Moose plates at the Town of Londonderry? \r\nYes. We are now online with the State of New Hampshire and can provide this service to you. \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\nDepartment Organizational Chart \nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tSherry Farrell\r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail Sherry Farrell \r\nPhone:  603-432-1100 Ext. 422 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tAllison Parsons\r\nTax Collector / Deputy Town Clerk \r\nEmail Allison Parsons \r\nPhone:  603-432-1100 Ext. 423 \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 268B Mammoth Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Londonderry ,  NH   03053 \r\nPhone:  603-432-1100 Ext. 420 \r\nFax: 603-421-9617 \r\nClerk   Phone : 603-432-1100, ext. 420 \nTax Collector   Phone : 603-432-1100, ext. 421 \nHours of Operation \nMonday through Friday \n8:30 a.m. to 5 p.m. \nDepartment Staff \nKayla Chase , Deputy Tax Collector / Clerk Assistant \nLyndsey England , Clerk Assistant \nCarol Murphy , Clerk Assistant \nTracy Jobity , Clerk Assistant \nDebbie Desrochers , Clerk Assistant \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Town Documents \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Town Maps \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Londonderry \r\n268B Mammoth Road \r\nLondonderry, NH 03053 \r\nPhone:  (603) 432-1100 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Community Events \n         Community News \n         FAQs \n         Online Services \n         Trash & Recycling \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
